'TheSU2 trace is−2. EveryU1 pair commutes, so its commutator is1. ForSU2 matricesU=e^(iθσx),V=e^(iφσz), direct multiplication givesTrcomm=2[1−2sin²θsin²φ], recovering both the identity case and the Pauli case.',
'A concrete holonomy word has a reproducible gauge-invariant observable. The formula records noncommutativity rather than an unproved higher-categorical effect.',
