'Under a lifted inner action, iI4 staysiI4 for everyq. Under the conjugation action, aq with negative character sendsiI4 to−iI4. Thus the two presentations carry genuinely different action data before any lattice model is defined.',
'The action is part of the group’s definition. A label containing two factors does not choose it.',
